  {
    "id": 4901032260010,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "あのですねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040240010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260020,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "私、和泉さんがカメラに映ってて……\r\n『Ａ』の鍵も持っていたって話を聞いてます",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260030,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "彼女が犯人じゃないんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030190010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……そうですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "ではまず、\r\n彼女の行動を整理していきましょう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 300,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00439",
    "fg": "007431",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "和泉さんは、夜23時17分に『Ａ』の部屋に向かい\r\nその後、23時38分にロビーに戻ってきています",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "西城さんと芹沢さんのカメラが撮っていた動画があるので\r\nこちらはご納得いただけると思います",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "お弟子さま",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "鍵を持っていたなら、その20分の間に……\r\n『Ａ』を殺すこともできるのではありませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……いいえ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "櫻木さんたちと\r\n現場の絨毯の下を確認したところ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00197",
    "fg": "001921",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "今『Ａ』の遺体がある場所とは違う場所に\r\n血痕が広がっていました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "でも、それには引きずった跡などはなかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0327",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "質問ですっ！\r\n血って20分で乾かないんですか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260080,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "被害者は頭を殴られて、\r\nたくさんの血を流していたから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260090,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "愛依ちゃんが殺害後、20分以内に遺体を動かしたなら、\r\n絨毯の下にも跡がつくはずだと思います……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00690",
    "fg": "001921",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……和泉さんが『Ａ』の部屋に向かったときには\r\n既に彼は死んでいて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00730",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "雨に打たれているのを気の毒に思って、\r\n開いていた天窓を閉め、遺体を動かしたそうです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "『Ａ』のジャケットにあったメモのにじみ\r\nまた、遺体の周辺だけに雨の痕跡があったことからも……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "和泉さんの言葉は\r\nそれなりに信じられると見ていいでしょう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "また､彼女が部屋に向かう23時17分以前に\r\n犯行が行われたことも前提条件にしていいか、と……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "天窓から雨が降り込んでいたけれど、霧子が調べてくれた\r\n死亡推定時刻も、そう狂いはなかったというわけね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "雨で遺体が冷やされたなら、実際より前に\r\n誤認することがあっても、後に間違うことはないもの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260120,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "愛依ちゃんが遺体を動かしたことで、雨で冷やされた時間が\r\n短くなったからかもしれません……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "それに体温だけではなく、死後硬直や死斑なども\r\n時刻を割り出す材料にしています……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0453",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260130,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうなるとやっぱり、死亡推定時刻に\r\nアリバイのない私たちが怪しくなるね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260140,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……だけど、私は自分の無実を知っているから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260150,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "アリバイのある人よりも\r\n真実に近いところにいるのかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00277",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えーっと、ちょっと待ってくれよ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030110010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260160"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "今までの証言が全部正しいとしたら\r\n『Ａ』が持っていたはずの鍵をなんで愛依が持ってるんだ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260170"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "『Ａ』から鍵を手に入れた\r\n別の誰かがいたってことだよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103226/4901032260180"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 796,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032260190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "確かに……！\r\nじゃあ、その『誰か』は誰なんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
